  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the semolina and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
